{"seq":1,"slug":"shared-context-memory","title":"共享上下文与记忆","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/coordination/shared-context-memory","wordCount":1527,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"共享上下文与记忆\">共享上下文与记忆</h1><p>多个 agent 要协作，前提是它们对「现在做到哪了、已经知道了什么」有某种共同认知。但 LLM agent 之间不像人——它们没有持续的共享意识，每个 agent 只看得见自己上下文窗口里那点东西。所以多体系统里「共享什么、怎么共享、共享多少」就成了一道核心工程题。前面几篇反复提到的「按需最小供给」原则，到这里要被正面展开：它本质上是一个上下文工程问题，而且是多体场景下最难的那一类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>多体系统里的「记忆」可以按生命周期分层。最易混淆的两组是「私有 vs 共享」和「短时 vs 长时」。把它们正交起来看，记忆空间就清晰了。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  MEM[多体记忆体系] --&gt; PRIV[私有上下文&lt;br/&gt;单 agent 独占]&#10;  MEM --&gt; SHARE[共享状态&lt;br/&gt;跨 agent 可见]&#10;  PRIV --&gt; P1[工作记忆&lt;br/&gt;当前推理步]&#10;  SHARE --&gt; S1[短时共享&lt;br/&gt;本次任务的进度/中间产物]&#10;  SHARE --&gt; S2[长时共享&lt;br/&gt;跨任务的知识/经验]\">flowchart TD\n  MEM[多体记忆体系] --&gt; PRIV[私有上下文&lt;br/&gt;单 agent 独占]\n  MEM --&gt; SHARE[共享状态&lt;br/&gt;跨 agent 可见]\n  PRIV --&gt; P1[工作记忆&lt;br/&gt;当前推理步]\n  SHARE --&gt; S1[短时共享&lt;br/&gt;本次任务的进度/中间产物]\n  SHARE --&gt; S2[长时共享&lt;br/&gt;跨任务的知识/经验]</pre><p>不同层的记忆有不同的存放方式和访问规则，下表对照。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>记忆层</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>典型载体</th>\n<th>写入者</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>私有工作记忆</td>\n<td>单 agent</td>\n<td>自己的上下文窗口</td>\n<td>该 agent</td>\n<td>窗口溢出遗忘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短时共享状态</td>\n<td>本次任务全员</td>\n<td>黑板/共享 store</td>\n<td>任意 agent</td>\n<td>并发写冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长时共享知识</td>\n<td>跨任务</td>\n<td>向量库/外部存储</td>\n<td>经筛选写入</td>\n<td>陈旧、检索噪声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"共享状态的两种范式-黑板与消息\">共享状态的两种范式：黑板与消息</h2><p>让 agent 共享短时状态，主流有两种范式。第一种是黑板（blackboard）：所有 agent 读写同一块共享数据结构，谁需要就去看、有产出就写回。它的好处是全局状态一处可见，主管-工人里主管汇总结果就常用黑板。代价是并发写冲突——两个 agent 同时改同一处，后写覆盖先写，需要加锁或版本控制。</p>\n<p>第二种是消息传递：agent 之间不共享数据，而是显式地把信息「发」给特定对象，各自维护自己的局部视图。流水线的交接就是消息传递的一种——上一棒把产物发给下一棒。消息传递天然避免了共享写冲突，但代价是没有单一全局真相，容易出现各 agent 视图不一致。两种范式的选择，往往直接对应你选的拓扑：中心化的主管-工人偏黑板，去中心的<a href=\"../patterns/pipeline-handoff\">流水线</a>偏消息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多体上下文工程的核心张力\">多体上下文工程的核心张力</h2><p>单 agent 的上下文工程已经够难，多体把难度又抬了一层，核心张力是：每个 agent 既要看到足够多以完成协作，又不能被其它 agent 的中间产物淹没。给得太少，agent 不知道队友在干什么，做出局部自洽却全局矛盾的结果；给得太多，token 成本随 agent 数膨胀，且 agent 被无关信息带偏注意力。</p>\n<p>这道张力可以量化地理解。设系统有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 个 agent，若采用「全量广播」让每个 agent 都看到全部上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，则总上下文开销约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\cdot |C|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，随 agent 数线性膨胀，且大部分是冗余。理想做法是给每个 agent <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 只供给它完成任务所需的最小充分子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⊆</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i \\subseteq C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>，总开销降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i |C_i| \\ll m \\cdot |C|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。这就是<a href=\"../patterns/supervisor-worker\">主管-工人模式</a>里「按需最小供给」、以及<a href=\"../patterns/pipeline-handoff\">流水线</a>里「交接最小充分集」背后统一的原理——在不同拓扑上长出的同一棵树。</p>\n<h2 id=\"压缩与外置-对抗窗口溢出\">压缩与外置：对抗窗口溢出</h2><p>当任务足够长，连私有工作记忆都会溢出窗口。两个标准手段值得掌握。其一是压缩：当上下文填充率超过某个阈值（一个常用经验是过半就主动压），把早期的对话历史和中间产物总结成更短的摘要，腾出窗口空间。压缩是有损的，所以要保留「不可丢」的关键事实（如任务目标、已确认的约束）。</p>\n<p>其二是外置记忆：把不需要一直在窗口里的信息搬到外部存储（文件、数据库、向量库），需要时再检索回来，即「即时取用」（just-in-time）。长时共享知识几乎都应外置——跨任务的经验放在向量库里，agent 用到才检索，而不是塞进每次的提示词。外置的代价是检索质量：检索回噪声会污染上下文，检索不全又等于没存。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  CTX[agent 上下文窗口] --&gt; FILL{填充率&lt;br/&gt;是否过半?}&#10;  FILL --&gt;|否| KEEP[继续累积]&#10;  FILL --&gt;|是| ACT[主动处理]&#10;  ACT --&gt; CMP[压缩历史为摘要&lt;br/&gt;保留不可丢事实]&#10;  ACT --&gt; EXT[早期产物外置&lt;br/&gt;需要时即时检索]&#10;  CMP --&gt; CTX&#10;  EXT --&gt; STORE[(外部存储/向量库)]\">flowchart TD\n  CTX[agent 上下文窗口] --&gt; FILL{填充率&lt;br/&gt;是否过半?}\n  FILL --&gt;|否| KEEP[继续累积]\n  FILL --&gt;|是| ACT[主动处理]\n  ACT --&gt; CMP[压缩历史为摘要&lt;br/&gt;保留不可丢事实]\n  ACT --&gt; EXT[早期产物外置&lt;br/&gt;需要时即时检索]\n  CMP --&gt; CTX\n  EXT --&gt; STORE[(外部存储/向量库)]</pre><h2 id=\"共享记忆的污染风险\">共享记忆的污染风险</h2><p>共享记忆是把双刃剑：它让协作成为可能，也让一个 agent 的错误能污染全员。如果一个 agent 把错误的中间结论写进了共享黑板，后续读到它的 agent 都会在错误基础上构建——这是「集体幻觉」在记忆层的根源。更微妙的是，过度共享会削弱本应独立的判断：在<a href=\"../patterns/parallel-fanout\">并行扇出</a>的冗余投票里，分支必须保持独立才有意义，若它们共享了太多中间状态，错误就会相关，投票失效。同样，在<a href=\"conflict-resolution\">冲突解决</a>里，一个本应客观的裁判 agent 如果和被裁判者共享了过多上下文，就会从仲裁者堕落成同谋。所以「共享」从来不是越多越好，它是要被审慎设计的最小化对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>多体记忆按「私有 vs 共享」和「短时 vs 长时」两维分层；不同层有不同载体、写入规则和风险。</li>\n<li>短时共享有两种范式：黑板（全局可见、需防写冲突）和消息传递（局部视图、避免冲突但无单一真相），选择常与拓扑对应。</li>\n<li>多体上下文工程的核心张力是「足够多但不淹没」，统一原则是给每个 agent 最小充分子集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，把开销从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\cdot|C|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i|C_i|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>对抗窗口溢出靠压缩（过半主动压、保留不可丢事实）和外置记忆（即时取用，代价是检索质量）。</li>\n<li>共享记忆会传播污染，过度共享还会削弱独立判断，因此「共享」是要被最小化设计的对象，与<a href=\"conflict-resolution\">冲突解决</a>直接相关。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"共享上下文与记忆","id":"共享上下文与记忆"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"共享状态的两种范式：黑板与消息","id":"共享状态的两种范式-黑板与消息"},{"level":2,"text":"多体上下文工程的核心张力","id":"多体上下文工程的核心张力"},{"level":2,"text":"压缩与外置：对抗窗口溢出","id":"压缩与外置-对抗窗口溢出"},{"level":2,"text":"共享记忆的污染风险","id":"共享记忆的污染风险"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并行扇出","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/patterns/parallel-fanout"},"next":{"title":"通信协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/agent-orchestration/coordination/communication-protocols"}}